WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:05.752
Mike is a student at Woodlawn Elementary School.

2
00:00:06.853 --> 00:00:08.114
He is in the fourth grade.

3
00:00:09.154 --> 00:00:14.578
There are fifteen students in his class─seven girls and eight boys.

4
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:18.101
It is springtime.

5
00:00:19.042 --> 00:00:21.223
The students love to play outside.

6
00:00:22.204 --> 00:00:24.085
It's time to go to PE class.

7
00:00:25.086 --> 00:00:27.528
Mr. Rabinovich is the PE teacher.

8
00:00:29.056 --> 00:00:30.557
He is a very nice teacher.

9
00:00:31.637 --> 00:00:34.298
He and the students are having class outside today.

10
00:00:35.819 --> 00:00:37.420
It's too nice to play inside.

11
00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:41.802
"What are we going to play today?"

12
00:00:42.562 --> 00:00:43.503
the students ask.

13
00:00:44.803 --> 00:00:47.164
"Whatever you kids want to play," Mr.

14
00:00:47.184 --> 00:00:48.545
Rabinovich says.

15
00:00:48.565 --> 00:00:50.846
"It's your decision."

16
00:00:53.147 --> 00:00:55.308
The girls decide they want to play soccer.

17
00:00:56.604 --> 00:00:59.245
Seven boys decide they want to play baseball.

18
00:00:59.265 --> 00:01:02.146
"It's all up to Mike," Mr.

19
00:01:02.166 --> 00:01:03.466
Rabinovich says.

20
00:01:03.486 --> 00:01:07.207
"Do you want to play soccer or baseball, Mike?"

21
00:01:09.708 --> 00:01:12.469
Mike, the eighth boy, looks at the other boys.

22
00:01:13.769 --> 00:01:15.129
Then he looks at the girls.

23
00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:19.851
"Well, I don't want to play baseball."

24
00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:23.852
"Hooray!" the girls scream.

25
00:01:25.464 --> 00:01:28.726
"And I don't want to play soccer," Mike says.

26
00:01:29.747 --> 00:01:30.787
Everyone is quiet.

27
00:01:33.289 --> 00:01:37.791
"You don't want to play baseball, and you don't want to play soccer?"

28
00:01:38.271 --> 00:01:39.952
Mr. Rabinovich asks.

29
00:01:39.972 --> 00:01:43.454
"Well, Mike, what do you want to play?"

30
00:01:45.775 --> 00:01:47.016
Mike looks at the girls.

31
00:01:47.977 --> 00:01:48.997
They are not happy.

32
00:01:49.998 --> 00:01:51.539
Then Mike looks at the boys.

33
00:01:52.639 --> 00:01:54.000
They are not happy either.

34
00:01:55.072 --> 00:01:57.833
"Come on, Mike," one of the boys says.

35
00:01:57.853 --> 00:02:01.515
"Do you want to play baseball or soccer?"

36
00:02:01.535 --> 00:02:05.857
"I want to play kickball," Mike says.

37
00:02:05.877 --> 00:02:08.878
"You want to play kickball?"

38
00:02:09.378 --> 00:02:10.659
one of the girls asks.

39
00:02:10.679 --> 00:02:13.280
"Yes," Mike says.

40
00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:17.182
"That's stupid," one of the boys says.

41
00:02:17.202 --> 00:02:22.624
"He can't choose kickball," one of the girls says.

42
00:02:23.712 --> 00:02:26.354
"He can only pick baseball or soccer."

43
00:02:27.615 --> 00:02:29.516
The boys and girls start yelling.

44
00:02:30.537 --> 00:02:32.458
Everyone is angry except for Mr.

45
00:02:32.478 --> 00:02:33.719
Rabinovich and Mike.

46
00:02:36.821 --> 00:02:39.423
"Okay, that's enough yelling," Mr.

47
00:02:39.443 --> 00:02:40.804
Rabinovich says.

48
00:02:40.824 --> 00:02:43.686
"We're going to play a game of kickball.

49
00:02:44.866 --> 00:02:46.227
So pick your teams."

50
00:02:47.328 --> 00:02:48.869
The students pick their teams.

51
00:02:50.090 --> 00:02:52.792
There are three boys and four girls on one team.

52
00:02:55.704 --> 00:02:58.565
There are three girls and four boys on the other team.

53
00:03:00.185 --> 00:03:02.566
Mike is the only student not on a team.

54
00:03:02.586 --> 00:03:10.288
"We don't want him on our team," the team with three boys and four girls says.

55
00:03:12.169 --> 00:03:15.630
"We don't want him either," the other team says.

56
00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:19.131
"Now children," says Mr.

57
00:03:19.151 --> 00:03:24.152
Rabinovich. "We asked Mike to choose a game to play.

58
00:03:25.236 --> 00:03:26.417
He chose kickball.

59
00:03:26.817 --> 00:03:27.918
Let him play too.

60
00:03:28.998 --> 00:03:33.461
But Mike, next time, remember that you can't play what you want."

61
00:03:34.581 --> 00:03:35.502
So Mr.

62
00:03:35.542 --> 00:03:39.164
Rabinovich joins one team and Mike joins the other.
